     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>A binomial trial has two outcomes. A binomial experiment is an experiment with a fixed number of repeated binomial trials, where each trial has the same probability of success.</p>\n<p>This is not binomial because it has more than two outcomes.</p>\n"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "Not binomial (more than two outcomes)"
    }
   ],
